      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235295/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a large pot over medium heat. Add onion and garlic; cook and stir until softened and browned, 7 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pS0UQYkYYHbnd8TEmd1O0GziWkA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235295-curried-butternut-squash-soup-VAT-step-02-9736c7d5c2a842ddb8636856d7b4641c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235295/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in broth, butternut squash, curry powder, salt, cumin, and cayenne pepper; bring to a boil. Reduce the heat to low and simmer until squash is tender, about 15 minutes. Remove from the heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/89WldE3CCYavs6nRuYWOQjcvQV8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235295-curried-butternut-squash-soup-VAT-step-03-28fef88179a14264b2d068883716a9bd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235295/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in half-and-half and honey. Puree soup with an immersion blender until smooth.",
      "section": null,
